  "prefLabel": "Ec-Air 201.05 Issuance of Documents",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ec-Air 201.05 Issuance of Documents. All orders, decisions, notices, or other written correspondence or documents issued by or at the direction of the council or presiding officer shall be rebuttably presumed to have been issued on the date noted on the document.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Ec-Air 200) #13642, eff 5-23-23",
